<title>SPAIN: Cableuropa to expand deal with U S West.</title>
<headline>Cableuropa to expand deal with U S West.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish cable television and telephone consortium Cableuropa is to expand its collaboration with U S West Communications Corp, a spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Up to now Cableuropa had a very limited cooperation agreement with U S West to operate within the cable business in Barcelona, but from now on we will present joint cable bids in the auctions called by the Development Ministry in different Spanish regions,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
